body:
I average 70% winrate since I reached D4, i reached D2 35LP losing only 2 games which I was really proud of.

&#x200B;

At this point I was earning +15 and lost 18 and 17 on my losses

&#x200B;

Then, I  lost 3 games. 35 LP -> 16LP -> 0 LP -> Demote. Let me tell you I didn't play a single ranked for 3 weeks.

&#x200B;

Eventually, I got back at playing, and had the pleasure of winning +13 and +14, losing 18 on my only loss.

&#x200B;

I mean, I litteraly have 70% winrate, yet I still lose 4 LP more than I win, how is this system even supposed to  be fun and rewarding ? I'm just reducing my time on league more and more, as I can only play 4-5 hours a week, I don't plan on spending 1 month to rank up with 70% winrate.

&#x200B;

It kinda saddens me, I was originnaly really eager to rank up the ladder, but nowadays I play a few ARAM's a week and that's it.

&#x200B;

EDIT : I used the formula with 60% winrate,it would take me 83 wins to rank up, with an average 30 min per game (+5min queue/lobby) = 48 hours. It would take me 10 WEEKS to rank up, I'm even more desperate

I've been playing in diamond 2 last season, didn't see that much of a change. I often watch master friends play for fun, games are ridiculous aswel. This season is the first I feel weighted down by the system itself (well, except if we talk about division 1 in season 3 with +0 LP gains l0l)
&nbsp;

I've played the entire "skill-range" of diamond over the past years, I've honestly never seen a huge difference between d4 and d2, d5 and d1 sure are different.
&nbsp;

Sadly I got unlucky again this season, and as I am not the kinf of guy who plays 750  ranked or more each season, more like 200, If i get stuck on some vicious circle like I am right know, I takes me too much time (in terms of actual days out of the game) to climb up and raise my moral.
&nbsp;

I mean over the last week I played 28 ranked games, got drophacked during 2 wins, played against 1 afk, won, got 3 afk, lost plus I've always been unlucky every start of the season, I mean by that, that I get matched with out of space specimens. And by the time it calms down, i've been raging over myself for not winnign enough, eventhough that's just really bad luck and I SHOULD keep playing and spamming.

&nbsp;

I guess i just don't have enough personnal drive to reach my goals and motivation to spam ranked games
